(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".doc") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".docx") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".xls") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".xlsx") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".ppt") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".pptx") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".rtf") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".pdf") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".txt"))) AND (((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "dir ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /b ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /s "))) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "FINDSTR.EXE") AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /e ") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /si ")))))
